  m_text: "\u5236\u4F5C\u30FB\u958B\u767A\uFF1AHomerun Derby / World Tour\n\nBGM\n\nTitle
    BGM: Opening Theme For Soccer Video Games\nMusic: SOUND AIRYLUVS by ISAo\nhttps://airyluvs.com/\nLicense:
    OGA-BY 3.0\nhttps://static.opengameart.org/OGA-BY-3.0.txt\nSource: https://opengameart.org/content/opening-theme-for-soccer-video-games\n\nWorld
    Selection BGM: Racing Game Menu\nArtist: MintoDog\nLicense: CC0 1.0\nhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\nSource:
    https://opengameart.org/content/racing-game-menu\n\nStage Selection BGM: Funked
    Up\nArtist: Joth\nLicense: CC0 1.0\nhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\nSource:
    https://opengameart.org/content/funked-up\n\n\u97F3\u6E90\u306F\u914D\u5E03\u5143\u306EMP3\u3092\u52A0\u5DE5\u305B\u305A\u306B\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u4F7F\u7528\u6280\u8853\u30FB\u30A2\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\nUnity
